{"surah":92,"ayahs":["وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَىٰ","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>هَارِ إِذَا تَجَلَّىٰ","وَمَا خَلَقَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>ذَّكَرَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نثَ</span>ىٰٓ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> سَعْيَكُمْ لَشَتَّىٰ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا مَنْ أَعْطَىٰ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>تَّقَىٰ","وَصَدَّقَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحُسْنَىٰ","فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> لِلْيُسْرَىٰ","وَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>ا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">مَنۢ بَ</span>خِلَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>سْتَغْنَىٰ","وَكَذَّبَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحُسْنَىٰ","فَسَنُيَسِّرُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> لِلْعُسْرَىٰ","وَمَا يُغْنِى عَنْهُ مَالُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">ۥٓ</span> إِذَا تَرَدَّىٰٓ","إِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> عَلَيْنَا لَلْهُدَىٰ","وَإِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span> لَنَا لَلْأَخِرَةَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأُولَىٰ","فَأَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نذَ</span>رْتُكُمْ نَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">رًا تَ</span>لَظَّىٰ","لَا يَصْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">لَٰ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">هَآ</span> إِلَّا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَشْقَى","ٱلَّذِى كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","وَسَيُجَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span>بُهَا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَتْقَى","ٱلَّذِى يُؤْتِى مَالَهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> يَتَزَكَّىٰ","وَمَا لِأَحَدٍ عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ندَ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">مِن نِّ</span>عْمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ةٍ تُ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>زَىٰٓ","إِلَّا <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span>تِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">غَآ</span>ءَ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">جْ</span>هِ رَبِّهِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَعْلَىٰ","وَلَسَوْفَ يَرْضَىٰ"]}